  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Double standards in international law and multilateral institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will conduct research and analysis, with a focus on conceptualizing concerns around &#x201c;double standards&#x201d; and the corresponding implications for perceptions of the legitimacy of international law and institutions. The project will produce insights regarding the particular benefits for small, vulnerable, and developing States arising from the equal application of international law.</narrative>
  </description>
